# Eaten by Piranhas has flash: Bot1 casts it in Bot2's end step onto Bot2's Curious Farm Animals (CR 702.8a). The creature
# loses all abilities (CR 613.1f), its activated one included: in Bot1's upkeep Bot2, holding three Moxen and with Bot1's
# Mox Sapphire to destroy, is not offered "{2}, Sacrifice this creature: Destroy up to one target artifact or enchantment",
# while its Haywire Mite's own sacrifice ability is (the positive control), exiling the Mox. The Mite's "When this creature
# dies, you gain 2 life" triggers; then Bot1's Lightning Bolt kills the Farm Animals, whose "When this creature dies, you gain
# 3 life" it no longer has (it left as a Skeleton with no abilities, CR 603.10a): Bot2 ends at 22, not 25.

